Circle (surface): stroke var(--accent), stroke-width 1.5, fill: a subtle accent radial? Use fill: var(--surf-fill), define --surf-fill: rgba accent 0.06 per theme. Clearance: stroke var(--accent-2), dashed 4 4, fill rgba(amber,.05).

Ray: stroke var(--text-dim) width 1.5? Use accent for the ray. Dots: fill accent (p0 is accent-2?). Hit: fill accent-2.

